                <pb facs="0664" n="584" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg584"/>

                <head>Convention between the United States and Guatemala relating to the tenure and
                    disposition of real and personal property.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Guatemala, August 27, 1901.<lb/>Ratification
                        advised by the Senate, January 30, 1902.<lb/>Ratified by the President,
                        February 6, 1902.<lb/>Ratified by Guatemala, September 12,
                        1902.<lb/>Ratifications exchanged at Guatemala, September 16,
                        1902.<lb/>Proclaimed September 18, 1902.</hi></p>

                <xi:include href="ch190/d591.xml" xpointer="d591"/>
